le=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Moreover, I think he only described a deduction as elementary once.<br /> <br /> <br /> (I also think it's a misconception that Louis the big angster-whiner of the setting - Lestat has him beat ten times over there)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Haha yeah, Louis is someone who's getting that black pill forced down his throat and whines about it, Lestat is someone who eats black pills for breakfast and loves to bathe in his own agony and angst.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24044-ventrue-life","name":"Ventrue Life","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24044_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"386"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}